OL,3,AMPs vote against fresh move to legalise
OL,4,Aassisted dying in England and Wales
OL,5,
OL,6,FMPs have voted against a fresh move to
OL,7,Flegalise assisted dying in England and
OL,8,FWales
OL,10,FThe bill was defeated with 270 MPs
OL,11,Fvoting for and 286 voting against -
OL,12,Fwhat happens now?
OL,14,F"Parliament has dropped the ball today.
OL,15,FIt will be picked up again as it must
OL,16,Fbe," bill sponsor MP Lauren Edwards
OL,17,Fsays, while Kim Leadbeater says "a lot
OL,18,Fof MPs are very upset about what
OL,19,Fhappened today"
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
