OL,3,AMPs vote against fresh move to legalise
OL,4,Aassisted dying in England and Wales
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut campaign group Assist Us To Live
OL,7,Fdescribes the result as a "victory" for
OL,8,Fdisabled and terminally ill people
OL,10,FIt was the second attempt to change the
OL,11,Flaw - last year an identical bill was
OL,12,Fsupported by MPs, but stalled and ran
OL,13,Fout of time in the House of Lords
OL,15,FThe bill would have allowed adults with
OL,16,Ffewer than six months to live to apply
OL,17,Fto be given help to end their own life,
OL,18,Fsubject to certain safeguards
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
