OL,3,AHouthis claim major advance in Yemen as
OL,4,Agroup reportedly seizes island in key
OL,5,Ashipping route
OL,6,
OL,7,FFighters from the Iran-backed Houthi
OL,8,Fmovement have "taken control" of a key
OL,9,Fisland on the Red Sea, a government
OL,10,Fsource says
OL,12,FPerim Island divides the Bab al-Mandab
OL,13,FStrait, the southern gateway to a trade
OL,14,Froute that links Asia and Europe -
OL,15,Fhere's why it is significant
OL,17,FIn a statement, the Houthis say
OL,18,F"maritime navigation is safe for all
OL,19,Fcompanies except for Saudi vessels" and
OL,20,Fclaim their military operation has been
OL,21,Fa "success" - but they do not mention
OL,22,FPerim Island
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
