OL,3,AAnthropic blocks possible attempt to
OL,4,Ause AI to make biological weapons
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnthropic says it has identified and
OL,7,Fdisrupted attempts to use its AI model
OL,8,Ffor "malicious activity" which could
OL,9,Fsupport the development of biological
OL,10,Fweapons.
OL,12,FThe findings, made in the firm's recent
OL,13,Fthreat intelligence report, is the
OL,14,Flatest in a growing series of warnings
OL,15,Ffrom AI researchers and industry
OL,16,Finsiders about the technology's
OL,17,Fpotential risks to humanity.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
