OL,3,AHong Kong's Tiananmen activists
OL,4,Asentenced to up to seven years in
OL,5,Aprison
OL,6,
OL,7,FThree Hong Kong activists who organised
OL,8,Fannual vigils commemorating Beijing's
OL,9,F1989 crackdown on Tiananmen Square
OL,10,Fprotests have been handed prison
OL,11,Fsentences of up to seven years.
OL,13,FTwo of the defendants - Lee Cheuk-yan,
OL,14,F69, and Chow Hang-tung, 41 - were
OL,15,Fconvicted last month of inciting others
OL,16,Fto subvert state power, under the
OL,17,Fcity's controversial national security
OL,18,Flaw.
OL,20,FA third defendant, Albert Ho, 74, had
OL,21,Fpleaded guilty in January.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
